WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
From a low lunge, place blocks on either side of the front foot.

2
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Slowly slide the front heel forward and the back knee back.

3
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Support the front hip with a block or bolster as you descend.

4
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Keep the hips square and the back toes pointed. Rise gently; switch sides.
